  "description": "Shared abstractions for EngineeredWood: offset-based (range-oriented) I/O, pure-managed compression (Snappy/Zstd/LZ4/Brotli), and Apache Arrow helpers. Preliminary 0.3.0 — APIs may change before 1.0.0.",
